    <step order="2">H12c: same for the OpenAI endpoint; remove `SharedPlatformOpenAiEndpoint` from options, module, rejection codes, Worker Program, Bicep (module + platform-controlplane + recompiled JSON + dev bicepparam) and the `AzureOpenAI-Endpoint` entry of `Seed-PlatformKeyVault.ps1` (fix its "6 secrets" / "seed all 5" count drift). Update H12c tests.</step>
    <step order="3">G6: validator pairing in `RunsEndpoints` + `KnownProfiles`; `intake.schema.json` allOf; RunsEndpointsTests + every fixture that pairs Model1 with the trial profile; spec.md ADR-020 row extension; skill Step 1c / 1e prose (main session).</step>
    <step order="4">G21: secret-free by default for new stamps — `KvSecretsPopulationOptions.RequireSecretFreeIdentity` true by default AND set explicitly in the Worker Bicep; remove the `Dataverse-ClientSecret` / `BFF-API-ClientSecret` pins from `RunContextContractTests.PinnedManifestGaps`. Check the H2a `requireSecretFreeIdentity` intake key and `customer.bicep` param: if nothing consumes the Bicep param, remove both (and the ArmDeploymentRunner payload entry); if something does, default it true. Record the evidence.</step>
    <step order="5">D18: manifest removal + regenerate (generator `-Verify` clean); the `from-platform-vault` removal per the constraint; recompile `customer.json` / `platform-controlplane.json` if their inputs changed (`az bicep build --outfile`, never `--stdout`).</step>
    <step order="6">G13: rename `Model1SharedDagParityTests.cs` (file + class) to a name that states what it pins (e.g. `TenancyModelDagParityTests`).</step>
    <step order="7">Docs: inventory, deployment guide, prerequisites guide / `prereqs.yaml` (+ `validate.ps1`), gap note — remove the shared-endpoint and vendor-key rows; `.claude` constraints/patterns that name a removed option (main session) + CHANGELOG.</step>
    <step order="8">Verify: ControlPlane Api/Worker/Tests/LoadTests build 0 warnings 0 errors; ControlPlane.Tests — no failures beyond the 6 T221 baseline; ArchTests pass; `bicep-e2e-dry-run.ps1` PASS; prereqs `validate.ps1` OK; catalog `-Verify` OK; repeat the Step 0 grep → only historical records remain (list them).</step>
    <step order="9">Step 9.5 quality gates (code-review + adr-check). Close: POML notes, TASK-INDEX `✅ [done]`, plan §4 G6/G13/G21 + §7 T225b, current-task.md; `scripts/check-task-status-drift.ps1`. Commit + push.</step>
  </steps>

