    hard-stops Model 1 until T228 (adr W1, ADR-027 path C); I2 probe header records it cannot see bleed between Model 1
    customers (all carry Spaarke's tenantId — isolation is the per-stamp service); spec ADR-027 / B04 rows + a blank
